<p><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">You can call us on 0203 808 7099 or reply to this email. Our service team are available from 9:00 to 18:00 Monday to Friday (excluding bank holidays).&nbsp;<br />
<br />
Once we get your reply, we’ll deal with it straight away for you. However, if we don't hear back from<br />
you, the policy will stay active and will not be cancelled.</span></p>
